      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The game already has an uncapped frame rate. If you have an index set to 144 and a capable PC, you can run it at that frame rate.\nHowever, i do agree that more optimization is definitely needed, especially in terms of CPU utilization when rendering other avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-04-01T08:23:19.576Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Uncapped frame rate and possibly better optimisation would allow index users to run at 120-144hz. It would allow for smoother gameplay.\nGeneral optimisation IS needed. The game chugs on even the beefiest hardware, with common frame drops, freezes and such.",
